      "content": "but what if there isn't a path? what if \"moving forward\" just means carrying this rot around for the next forty years and watching it infect everything else i try to do? it feels like i'm just poisoning the air around me. if i'm truly a bad person, then living is just... it's just letting the poison spread. wouldn't it be more honest to just stop being a source of harm?",
